<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 841 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 841 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to September 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to September 13 SPFC:  Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 35,327	 34,486</p>
<p> Money market intervention    13,541	 14,585</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		6,299	  6,297</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,432	  2,432</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,660	 65,840</p>
<p>In the previous week, to September 13, reserves fell by 388 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
